===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|goh|dah}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*þaką}}; compare {{cog|nds-de|Dack}}, {{cog|nl|dak}}, {{cog|en|thack}}, {{m|en|thatch}}, {{cog|da|tag}}. Ultimately from {{inh|de|ine-pro|*teg-}}, and akin to Latin {{m|la|toga||garment}} and Ancient Greek {{m|grc|στέγος||roof}}.

